{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:704","content":{"id":704,"title":"跳跃游戏II","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"233988e0-2c67-48ab-8d55-b564b9f84541","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4db4a0c3-2137-4c94-8287-9f15b6ef1872","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给定一个非负整数数组，你最初位于数组的第一个位置，数组中的每个元素代表你在该位置可以跳跃的最大长度，你的目标是使用最少的跳跃次数到达数组的最后一个位置。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9e61db5f-6794-4cae-86fd-4d0690f70442","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"77af1c0a-9092-4869-a8df-d7e34938b7a8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f411318a-28d4-4b10-b849-bf5002f0353e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入: [2,3,1,1,4]\n输出: 2\n解释: 跳到最后一个位置的最小跳跃数是 2。\n\t   从下标为 0 跳到下标为 1 的位置，跳 1 步，\n     然后跳 3 步到达数组的最后一个位置。","collabId":"f9ad4912-559c-4d6d-bdaf-1f8bdf5edf05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"09857c38-21d8-44ba-96d7-6ff609e8281e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65905c2e-cac3-466f-b3ba-55ddf2d07b2d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先的想法就是使用递归，定义一个递归函数，它的输入有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"index"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"counts"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示经过从起点跳了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"counts"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 次到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"index"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处，该函数的输出为从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"index"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 处跳转到最后一个位置需要跳转的次数，很容易写出这样的代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"a87a3df5-528c-4e2a-b5c1-f11a16af3b28","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e1b085ac-e9b2-4632-9d29-7fa90ba7cb30","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"private int length;\npublic int jump(int[] nums) {\n    this.length = nums.length;\n    return jump(nums, 0, 0);\n}\n\nprivate int jump(int[] nums, int curIndex, int counts) {\n    // 跳过头了\n    if (curIndex > this.length - 1) {\n        return Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n    }\n\n    // 正好跳到最后一格\n    if (curIndex == this.length - 1) {\n        return counts;\n    }\n\n    int min = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= nums[curIndex]; i++) {\n        // 从 [curIndex + i] 处开始跳，取最小值\n        int t = jump(nums, curIndex + i, counts + 1);\n        min = Math.min(t, min);\n    }\n\n    return min;\n}","collabId":"b9c5e8fa-9e99-49f6-b8c1-dd8ba21320dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"571423c7-6213-48fd-a690-158562631251","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是代码一提交，发现超时了。仔细分析，发现有重复的计算，对于这种情况我们可以使用动态规划。我们定义一个数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dp[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示从下标 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 跳转到最后一个位置需要的最少的跳跃次数。因此我们可以得到如下的更新方程"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\text{dp}[i] = \n\\begin{cases}\n1 & i+\\text{num}[i] \\geq \\text{length} - 1\\\\\n\\min\\{ \\text{dp}[i + j] \\} + 1 (j\\in[1, \\text{num}[i]]) &i+\\text{num}[i] < \\text{length} - 1\n\\end{cases}","collabId":"6d1288d8-f270-41d3-a0e5-bb69ff066361","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"7582358d-affc-4036-b230-d07674433d3e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3d6958d3-d07a-440c-96cc-9c4fc2988ddd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int jump(int[] nums) {\n    int[] dp = new int[nums.length];\n    dp[nums.length - 1] = 0;\n    for (int i = nums.length - 2; i >= 0; i--) {\n        // nums[i] = 0，永远都跳不到最后一个\n        if (nums[i] == 0) {\n            dp[i] = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n            continue;\n        }\n\n        if (nums[i] + i >= nums.length - 1) {\n            dp[i] = 1;\n        } else {\n            dp[i] = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n            for (int j = 1; j <= nums[i]; j++) {\n                // 这里判断是防止溢出\n                if (dp[i + j] != Integer.MAX_VALUE) {\n                    dp[i] = Math.min(dp[i], dp[i + j] + 1);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return dp[0];\n}","collabId":"7b156f23-3f5d-48b1-ad32-526b2694a8fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"c21a3348-c621-4793-9e9b-8a32fff536b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"aa325132-9910-4485-8a78-76d5948e9483","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e6612e78-96b4-4f03-8ff0-393e4e12e156","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ff9a9924-e54f-4b68-a05c-ccef85e28549","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/jump-game-ii/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"16073338-a4b8-4137-8754-b7abebfcbd1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跳跃游戏II"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"52567fa0-e091-4bfb-af9d-e236c33e6aea","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"518c03cc-2b05-429a-b9cd-19b4a99bff07","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/jump-game-ii/solution/xiang-jie-dp-tan-xin-shuang-zhi-zhen-jie-roh4/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"815bfc3a-8ff3-4aa1-a9d2-e3f80a4c58fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"详解「DP + 贪心 + 双指针」解法，以及该如何猜 DP 的状态定义 ~"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"动态规划"},{"label":"跳跃游戏II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:704","type":"doc","id":704}}],"prevPage":{"title":"解码方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:695","type":"doc","id":695}},"nextPage":{"title":"最大子序和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:711","type":"doc","id":711}},"createTime":1729001676823,"updateTime":1744296683433,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296683433}}